Required notice for public use
--------------------------------
When publicly using a Produced Work based on the whole or a substantial part of this database, include a notice reasonably calculated to inform users that the content was obtained from this database and is available under the ODC Attribution License.

A suitable notice is:

"Contains information from the Kankoor Exam Questions Dataset by Salim Noor (Taikutsu Lyrz), available at https://github.com/Taikutsu-Lyrz/Afghanistan-kankoor-exam-dataset, which is made available under the Open Data Commons Attribution License (ODC-By) v1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/by/1-0/."

When publicly conveying the database, a derivative database, or the database as part of a collective database, follow the notice and license requirements in Section 4 of ODC-By v1.0, including keeping intact applicable copyright, database-right, and license notices.

